              "id": "DS1702",
              "name": "unscoped-ignore-entry",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An ignore-file entry or a baseline row that names a symbol and no file path."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An ignore-file entry or a baseline row that names a symbol and no file path. The entry is reported rather than matched, so a bare name cannot mask a match anywhere else in the project; the inline directive is scoped by its position and cannot be unscoped."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "An ignore-file entry or a baseline row that names a symbol and no file path. The entry is reported rather than matched, so a bare name cannot mask a match anywhere else in the project; the inline directive is scoped by its position and cannot be unscoped."
